  "name": "noise-rs",
  "description": "A high-performance procedural noise generation library for Rust, implementing a variety of gradient and coherent noise algorithms. It provides composable primitives for 2D, 3D, and 4D noise, including Perlin, OpenSimplex, and Simplectic honeycomb variations. The library supports multi-octave fractal brownian motion and ridged multi-fractal generation with customizable spectral weights.",
